# 6. HALAL CLASSIFICATION MODEL

Never use only:

HALAL
HARAM

Use nuanced classifications.

Possible ingredient statuses:

🟢 HALAL

Generally considered permissible based on known source.

🟢 PLANT-BASED

Known plant-derived ingredient.

🟢 SYNTHETIC/MINERAL

No relevant animal source normally expected.

🟡 SOURCE DEPENDENT

Could originate from plant, animal, microbial or synthetic sources.

🟠 MASHBOOH / QUESTIONABLE

Origin or processing requires verification.

🔴 NOT HALAL

Known prohibited ingredient/source.

🐷 PORK DERIVED

Known pork-derived ingredient.

⚪ UNKNOWN

Insufficient evidence.

